dback we've heard from you.In this update we:Added new accessibility options to reduce the intensity of movement lean and other camera shakes.Adjusted the positions of various hanging braziers to make them less awkward to light.Improved settings UI scaling on ultrawide aspect ratios. Let us know if you run into any issues, or have a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:22:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032426","verified_at":"2026-10-22T13:10:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123380-1846651706690914","game_id":"steam-5123380","kind":"announcement","title":"PITCHFORK is in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hello Peasants! PITCHFORK is in Steam Next Fest!To celebrate, update #3 is now live!In this update we: Updated the dithering shader to improve how the game looks on livestreams and recordings.Added anti vampire propaganda to the village. Fixed some spots peasants could become stuck within the village. Tweaked spike trap spawn rates.As always - please let us know if you run into any issues or have any ideas about what you'd like to see in the full game! Join our peasant congregation here: https:/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:58:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690914","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123380-1846651706686680","game_id":"steam-5123380","kind":"update","title":"PITCHFORK Demo Update #2","summary":"Hello Peasants! We're back again with another small update to improve your dungeon crawling endeavors. In this update we: Filled various small holes spotted in the caves. Added portal culling within the dungeon to reduce frame times on lower end hardware.Improved the usability of the settings menu.Tweaked the visuals of frost and shock effects so that their effects are clearer.Reduced the intensity of the feedback played when dealing damage.Made the fog in the village less distracting. Please le","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:40:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686680","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123380-1846651706676339","game_id":"steam-5123380","kind":"update","title":"PITCHFORK Demo Update #1","summary":"Hello Peasants! Thank you to those of you who have already played the demo. It's been really nice reading through your reviews, watching your streams, and chatting in the Discord! We have just released our first hotfix for the demo addressing: The entire screen flashing white on Steam Deck when certain particles were being played.The render scale being set lower than intended (your game may look a bit different now).We are aware of these bugs: A few small holes in caves. Occasionally being affli","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T04:39:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676339","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123380-1846651706673270","game_id":"steam-5123380","kind":"announcement","title":"PITCHFORK Demo is out NOW!","summary":"Hello Peasants! The Demo for PITCHFORK has JUST GONE LIVE! Gather your friends, and begin the climb up the Vampire's castle today!The Demo includes: Around an hour of playtime.Solo, or co-op play with up to 4 players. Proximity voice chat.The first procedural floor of the castle (the Sewers). Over 40 items.3 monsters.Many traps & puzzles.The full game includes: More floors. More items. More traps. More puzzles. More enemies. Character CustomizationAnd of course - the Vampire boss fight!PITCHFORK","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T06:05:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673270","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5123380-1846018067929473","game_id":"steam-5123380","kind":"announcement","title":"PITCHFORK at PAX Australia","summary":"Hey Peasants, PITCHFORK will be available to play at PAX Australia on Friday, Saturday and Sunday (9th - 11th October).You can find us in the PAX Rising section at booth PR16 - just across from the SuperLoop stand:If that map is too hard to follow, just look for us - we'll be in our finest garments: Lastly, we have a Discord server that you can join to keep up with all things PITCHFORK, ask us questions, as well as find other peasants to play with.https://discord.gg/qTAstVaDHPHope to see you the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T12:25:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929473","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5123380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5123380":"2026-10-26T08:42:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5123380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:41Z"},"5276540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:42Z"}},"con